menu "Coinbase decoder experiments"
    config COINBASE_RUST
        bool "Use experimental Rust coinbase reader"
        default n
        depends on IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3
        help
            Replace only binary transaction parsing with the allocation-free
            Rust reader. Address codecs and all other firmware stay in C.
            Requires the axeos-esp Rust toolchain; see tools/RUST_COINBASE_FR.md.

    config COINBASE_PROFILE
        bool "Log coinbase decoding time and memory"
        default n
        help
            Log one measurement per notification, after the timed section.
            Includes hex conversion, parsing and optional address decoding.
            Diagnostic builds only: serial logging itself affects scheduling.

    config MINING_WORK_PROFILE
        bool "Log work preparation and ASIC dispatch time"
        default n
        help
            Measure each generate_work attempt, including coinbase/Merkle
            hashing, job allocation and ASIC dispatch. Logs are emitted after
            timing. These are wall times, not isolated CPU utilization.
endmenu
